                                "example_id": "4c10c9e3-ad00-4dd8-b3a0-2bef7301ef61",
                                "sense_id": "2898566d-1118-3eab-816e-4b554c5733ec",
                                "text": "For that matter Somary doesn't lack name performers: John Wilbraham is the trumpet soloist and one of the recordists is David Munrow."
